  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the result for the recruitment of <strong>BCG Technician posts</strong> on the official website of UPSSSC.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">This recruitment was released for <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"903\">255 posts</strong>.</span> Applications for the UPSSSC BCG Technician Recruitment 2024 were accepted from <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1003\">08 July 2024</strong></span>, to <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1053\">07 August 2024</strong>.</span> Candidates who had applied this form can download their UPSSSC&nbsp;BCG Technician Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC&nbsp;BCG Technician Result 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No:- 10 Exam 2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start : <strong>08 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date for Apply : <strong>07 August 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Fee Payment :<strong>&nbsp;07 August 2024<br>\n</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Last Date :<strong> 14 August 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result : <strong>08 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date&nbsp;:<b> Notify Soon</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available&nbsp;<b>: Before Exam</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, Candidates : <strong>Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidates :<strong> Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC BCG Technician Notification 2024 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2024</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC BCG Technician Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC BCG Technician </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>2024 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 255 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 43.1559%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 43.1559%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BCG Technician</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">111</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">25</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">70</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">45</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSSSC Assistant Boring Technician Recruitment 2024 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UPSSSC PET Score Card 2023.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed their Class 10+2th (Intermediate) Exam from any recognize board in India will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">2 years of diploma in Tuberculosis TB Program Management</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Registered in Homeopathic Medicine Board.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPSSSC BCG Technician Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Result link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download it from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC BCG Technician Recruitment 2024 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shortlisting (PET 2023 Score)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Skill Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariE